window.bookSummaryJSON = "<i>Can you meet for dinner at Dr. Reed's? 9pm. Urgent.</i><br><br>College freshman Walter Halloway has no idea this text message is going to change his life forever. All he knows is that graduate student Katy Plemons, whom he affectionately refers to as the Godgirl, is the woman of his dreams. Hyper-intelligent, drop-dead-gorgeous, and always sporting black lipstick and knee-high leather boots, she haunts his every waking thought and seduces him in his dreams.<br><br>And now Katy wants Walter to meet up for pizza at his biology professor's house on a shady street a couple blocks from campus. Walter can't imagine what Katy could possibly want from him, and he never would have guessed that he'd arrive to find her all alone, Dr. Reed nowhere to be found, and a weird request on the table--one that might make this the best night of his life . . .<br><br>. . . or his worst nightmare.<br><br><b>Content Warning:</b> <i>This story is intended for adults only.</i>"; 
